# ==== Vault TLS (generated by deploy/vault/gen-internal-tls.sh) ====
deploy/vault/certs/

# ==== Python locks that nothing installs from ====
# The runtime image installs from backend/requirements.lock alone
# (backend/Dockerfile). backend/uv.lock was tracked but read by nothing, and a
# tracked-but-unread lock is worse than no lock: the weasyprint 68 -> 69 bump
# updated it and left the shipping lock on the vulnerable version, which is why
# scripts/check_lock_consistency.py exists. Ignored so `uv lock` cannot quietly
# reintroduce it. If reproducible dev environments are wanted, make uv the
# single source of truth (uv lock + uv export) rather than untracking this.
backend/uv.lock

